esno and is looking at financing for a new warehouse forklift fleet. Her office line is 559-555-0124.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Leah, Pat runs Your Company and is the person I mentioned.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Best,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sam<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sam Ortega | Valley Ag Advisors | 559-555-0108<o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
